OL,3,AWelsh actress follows in footsteps of
OL,4,AFlorence Pugh and Benedict Cumberbatch
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Welsh actress named in a prestigious
OL,7,Fline-up that has previously featured
OL,8,Fthe likes of Benedict Cumberbatch and
OL,9,FFlorence Pugh says the selection was
OL,10,F"so unexpected" that she forgot she
OL,11,Fapplied.
OL,13,FLeisa Gwenllian portrays Effi in the
OL,14,FWelsh language film Effi o Blaenau,
OL,15,Fwhich follows a young woman as she
OL,16,Fgrapples with unemployment in a north
OL,17,FWales town before a night out drinking
OL,18,Fdramatically alters her life.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
