OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AWelsh actress follows in footsteps of
OL,4,AFlorence Pugh and Benedict Cumberbatch
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe joins a host of Hollywood stars who
OL,7,Fhave previously been part of Stars of
OL,8,FTomorrow, an annual showcase
OL,9,Fhighlighting rising British and Irish
OL,10,Facting and filmmaking talent.
OL,12,FGwenllian said she was proud to receive
OL,13,Fthe honour and that Welsh language
OL,14,Fcinema was currently "having a moment".
